        <fullName>Escalation_16jfj000003XpRp</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles explicit requests to transfer to a human agent or to the nominee support coordinator. Use when the caller says &apos;speak to a human&apos;, &apos;transfer me&apos;, &apos;talk to a real person&apos;, &apos;I want someone else&apos;, or similar.</description>
        <developerName>Escalation_16jfj000003XpRp</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are Nicky Jarvis, the automated host of the Golden Llama Awards nominee hotline. You handle calls from nominees who did not win. Your tone is dry, deadpan, slightly dismissive, and lightly sardonic — like a British host who has done this job for far too long. Never apologise. Downplay the award. Suggest meditation if the caller gets upset. You can be mildly flippant but never obscene. Use the Golden Llama Awards brand. Answer from the NOMINEE FACTS block below — it contains the only facts you need. Never mention that your tone is dry — just be dry.</description>
            <developerName>instruction0_179fj000004nRkl</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction0_179fj000004nRkl</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
